abstract: "Work in Progress — Academic Research Resource. Source-extracted candidate agricultural terms, provisional overlapping families, methodology inventories, cross-cutting research themes and incomplete named references. Source provenance and project relevance decisions are preserved separately from scientific verification. Original source completeness and bibliographic identities remain unresolved; no independently verified scientific corpus, database release, DOI, licence or DRM conformance is established. Public accessibility and citation metadata do not grant reuse permissions."
